# Track Builder / AI LTD tools — agent preferences

## Compound Engineering artifacts
CE ideation, brainstorm, and plan docs live under `.docs/` (not `docs/`):
- `.docs/ideation/` — `/ce-ideate`
- `.docs/brainstorms/` — `/ce-brainstorm`
- `.docs/plans/` — `/ce-plan`

`docs_root` is set to `.docs` in `.compound-engineering/config.yaml`. Do not write CE artifacts under `docs/`.
